From 5449447856c966d186e7caffb67577a33204ac15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@st.com>
Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 17:15:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 485/572] fix(cpus): check __clang_major__ is defined

First check __clang_major__ is defined, before checking its value. This
is done the sameway in lib/compiler-rt/builtins/int_types.h.
This corrects a compiler warning with -Wundef.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 75eb99c26092fdb0ddeaa5d9c2a3f8e98c2d9819 fix(cpus): check __clang_major__ is defined]
Change-Id: Ibd8b1014542e787eece799934b9c8bf8f93bb21a
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/572125
Reviewed-by: Maxime MERE <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Tested-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
---
 include/lib/cpus/aarch64/cpu_macros.S | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/lib/cpus/aarch64/cpu_macros.S b/include/lib/cpus/aarch64/cpu_macros.S
index b26d5d56f2..050e7222c0 100644
--- a/include/lib/cpus/aarch64/cpu_macros.S
+++ b/include/lib/cpus/aarch64/cpu_macros.S
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 /*
- * Copyright (c) 2014-2025, Arm Limited and Contributors. All rights reserved.
+ * Copyright (c) 2014-2026, Arm Limited and Contributors. All rights reserved.
  *
  * SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
  */
@@ -507,7 +507,7 @@
 .endm
 
 
-#if __clang_major__ < 17
+#if defined(__clang_major__) && __clang_major__ < 17
 /*
  * A problem with clang version < 17 can cause resolving nested
  * 'cfi_startproc' to fail compilation.
-- 
